WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.270
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:07.010
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Hikaru Shidou,
along with Umi and Fuu...

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:07.310
Magic Knight Rayearth
...was summoned once again
to Cephiro, another world.

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.340
...was summoned once again
to Cephiro, another world.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.350
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.940
...and was at risk of eradication.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.820
The path of destruction
has finally reached the castle.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.960
Eagle of Autozam, who went
into the crown room with me...

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:34.800
...left the castle in his FTO after
promising a truce with Cephiro.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:42.570
I admitted to Umi and Fuu that either
Eagle or I can become the next Pillar.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:49.910
Both of them told me what they
thought about the Pillar system.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:54.490
That was when
Nova's Regalia appeared.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.420
And inside Regalia...

00:00:58.230 --> 00:00:59.350
Lantis?

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:08.060
I feel it trembling
in the bottom of my heart...

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.870
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:18.310
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:24.490
And my love, full of pride,
comes to life right in front of me.

00:01:28.790 --> 00:01:32.530
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.930
The warm, red
shades of the sunset...

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.520
...have a melancholy beauty.

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:45.710
Solitary tears fall into
the sea that I sealed away...

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.440
...inside my heart.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:53.710
The bright light that I missed
will not come back to me.

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:59.950
So I want freedom, just like the wind
that will come with the next sunrise.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:07.620
I feel it trembling in
the bottom of my heart...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.300
...both the light and
the darkness that I warmly embrace.

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:17.800
A chase for the dream
that I just can't give up on...

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:21.980
Someday I want to find for myself...

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:28.210
...a future that has no end.

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:37.150
An Endless Battle!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.100
Level one battle formation!

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:51.710
Full throttle! Give it what you can!

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:57.640
Eagle...

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.520
All the people that Hikaru loves...

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:21.400
I'll make sure you all
can be with Hikaru forever.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.930
That's not it, Nova!

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:36.110
Eagle!

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:46.460
Only the people
Hikaru loves are here.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:51.320
Let's take our time to play.
Here, nobody will bother us.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.700
Nova!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.170
Ms. Umi!

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.680
Ice...

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.920
Umi!

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:17.020
What's wrong?

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:22.200
I thought you grew
stronger, Magic Knights.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.030
Look out!

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.940
Hikaru, just you wait.

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:41.410
I'll kill them all for you soon.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.720
Stop it, Nova!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.000
They're just getting in my way...

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.500
All of you...

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:04.270
All of you...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.670
I hate you!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.250
Eagle!

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:23.950
Lightning Call!

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:42.470
Hikaru, you're more in love
with him than ever before.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:49.310
Flame Arrow!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.580
Lantis!

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:06.260
Lantis is in pain too!
Aren't you glad, Hikaru?

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:24.020
Why is this girl a part of Hikaru?

00:06:24.390 --> 00:06:28.650
Ms. Hikaru, what did you mean
by a shadow of your heart?

00:06:31.460 --> 00:06:34.090
Cephiro is a land of will.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:37.290
Monsters are all
created by people's hearts.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.200
Nova was also created by my heart!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:47.500
Right, the one who
gave birth to me was Hikaru.

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:51.050
But Mother Debonair
was the one who raised me.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:56.740
Mother taught me what
I should do for my beloved Hikaru.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.390
So that she'd never be sad again.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.520
So that everyone could be with her.

00:07:04.260 --> 00:07:07.350
She said I should just kill them all!

00:07:21.310 --> 00:07:23.870
It's all right! Just hold on tight!

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.080
Lafarga!

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.380
Are you all right?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.230
There, there...

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.320
Come on...

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.060
There, there...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:47.330
Why doesn't he cry if it's you?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:50.000
Maybe it's because
I'm the older sister?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.440
You should be more spirited.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:58.470
S-Sure...

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.750
The Magic Knights will definitely win.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:03.680
Sang Yung, some tea.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.180
R-Right.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:09.720
Lady Aska, you have
become so respectable.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:13.290
I will protect
the people of Cephiro too.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.630
I don't wish to see Fuu's sad face.

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.530
You, the child! Calm yourself!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.570
Here, have some tea.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.530
Hikaru... Umi...

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.370
Fuu...

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.410
Umi! Fuu!

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.160
Hikaru, let's play!

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.630
Nova, this isn't it...

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.170
I don't want everyone to die!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:09:00.130
I want to protect them all! I want to live
with my loved ones and be happy!

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.900
But, Mother...

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:08.480
Mother said if I killed everyone,
it would make you happy!

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.110
You're wrong!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:14.350
I am not wrong!

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.270
Eagle!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.700
Don't get in my way!

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:40.170
I'll kill you first!

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.390
Hikaru! Call out to Lantis by name!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:57.690
You're capable of waking Lantis up!

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:01.670
At this rate...

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.540
Everyone that you love, they'll all...

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.340
...die here!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:18.610
Eagle!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.490
He's not going to love you back...

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.790
Why are you falling for him?

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.600
The reason that I'm falling for him...

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:38.440
...even if he won't love me back...

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:45.140
...is because I can't
lie to my own heart!

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:49.880
Because the one person
I don't want to lie to is myself!

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:55.760
Lantis!

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:04.660
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:10.660
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:35.390
You okay?

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.660
Thank you...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.030
Don't cry!

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.460
Don't cry...

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.640
We promised them!

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:33.020
Umi! Fuu!

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.820
We'll hold her here!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.120
Ms. Hikaru,
please get Mr. Lantis back!

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.490
Lantis... Lantis...

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.860
Lantis!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.340
Lantis...

00:12:54.610 --> 00:12:56.840
Lantis!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.040
He woke up?

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:06.810
Why?

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.290
He has come to!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:12.050
Hikaru! Call for him again!

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.150
Lantis!

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:21.730
Hikaru...

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.200
Lantis!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:33.680
Hikaru!

00:13:33.680 --> 00:13:34.980
Hikaru!
Ms. Hikaru!

00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:03.440
Hikaru!

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:04.570
Ms. Hikaru!

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:10.010
Lantis!

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:35.970
The Cephiro that
Princess Emeraude loved...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.040
The country that I love as well.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:46.780
Presea...

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:50.320
Master Mage Clef?

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:56.390
Starting now, I will support this
castle using all of my magical power.

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:02.470
You're being reckless! To use
magic in your present condition...

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:08.210
The girls from another world
are risking their lives in battle.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:14.180
I wish to protect the ones
I love using everything I have as well.

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.180
Please stop, Clef!

00:15:18.150 --> 00:15:19.550
Don't worry.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.160
I will not die.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:28.100
I believe in the Magic Knights.

00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:32.690
I am sure that Hikaru
and the others will return alive.

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:38.530
If I die, I am sure that they will
be brought back to tears again...

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:42.100
Presea...

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:46.150
Ascertain Debonair's
whereabouts from Alcyone.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:50.550
And let the Magic Knights know...

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.990
...where she is.

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:01.190
Clef!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:06.830
Eagle...

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:08.320
Eagle!

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.430
Lantis...

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:16.970
Use the FTO to attack
this Rune-God with me in it.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.070
I refuse to.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.880
If you die, Hikaru will be saddened.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:32.020
I don't want to see tears on
the faces of the pretty Magic Knights.

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:37.390
Hikaru isn't like Princess Emeraude.

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:42.660
I'm sure she'll be able to choose
a future where she can be happy...

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:44.900
...with those she loves.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.200
Eagle!

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.110
You're in the way!

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:06.620
Who said I was going to die?

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.160
I'm not like Zagato.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.190
I won't choose a future...

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:17.240
...where I die with the one I love
because I cannot be with her.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:20.310
I'll escape exactly when
Nova's powers weaken.

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.500
So attack this Rune-God.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.850
All right.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.390
FTO...

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.950
Go!

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:58.010
Lightning Call!

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:11.160
No!

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:42.880
Lantis!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.010
Eagle!

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.960
Damn you.

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:52.890
A little more and I would've been
able to kill Cephiro's next Pillar.

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:55.700
You little bug!

00:19:04.550 --> 00:19:05.670
Lantis...

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:07.670
Please...

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.120
...make Hikaru happy.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:19.920
Eagle!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:47.040
Debonair!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.790
I won't let you go, Magic Knights!

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:56.250
Out of the way!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.060
Regalia!

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:27.320
Mother, my Rune-God...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.100
Mother Debonair!

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:38.200
Mother!

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:41.670
Begone, along with
those Magic Knights.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.370
Mother!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.640
Nova!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:56.480
Spiral Flash!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.470
Eagle...

00:21:18.910 --> 00:21:20.400
Eagle is...

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:26.750
That stupid idiot...

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.960
Is this all right...

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:38.960
Let us believe in Ms. Hikaru.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:40.120
Right...

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:43.140
Thank you, Umi, Fuu.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:44.730
But...

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:49.030
Nova is a problem within my heart.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:20.600
Shine someday.
Believing is just that.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:30.110
Because it gives me
the courage to live on now.

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:38.280
Blown by the winds of the ages.

00:22:39.660 --> 00:22:44.760
Groping around for tomorrow.

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:52.830
Darkness spreads,
and only worries...

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:59.540
...keep welling up.

00:23:01.850 --> 00:23:07.620
I will definitely find bright feelings...

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:14.320
...when I get over the sea of tears.

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:23.630
Someday I will find it,
and the unyielding future...

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:32.910
...will lead dreams
to a world full of light.

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.820
It's finally the last battle.

00:23:49.130 --> 00:23:50.130
Yes.

00:23:50.130 --> 00:23:56.040
Umi, Fuu, just as we promised,
we'll fight together till the very end.

00:23:56.470 --> 00:24:01.200
For the people we love
and for our own hearts!

00:24:01.810 --> 00:24:04.900
Next time on Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.010 --> 00:24:09.140
The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow
that the Believing Heart Opens!

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:10.020
The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow
that the Believing Heart Opens!

00:24:10.020 --> 00:24:11.420
The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow
that the Believing Heart Opens!
Eagle...

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:13.490
The Road to Victory: The Tomorrow
that the Believing Heart Opens!

00:24:13.490 --> 00:24:20.420
Who is it today?

00:24:21.500 --> 00:24:23.400
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:23.500 --> 00:24:24.470
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:24.470 --> 00:24:27.230
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:27.230 --> 00:24:28.740
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!

00:24:28.740 --> 00:24:29.460
Look forward to the next episode!
